%% Sequence: user sends a message (normal path). Failure paths: send-message-failures.mmd.
%% Rules and timers: docs/SEND_MESSAGE.md. Decisions: docs/ARCHITECTURE.md (D5, D8, D10, D11, D18, P1).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser (SPA)
  participant G as Google
  participant A as API (FastAPI, Fargate)
  participant DB as Postgres (Neon)
  participant R as AgentCore runtime

  Note over B,A: Every Browser → API call goes through the ALB (api.<domain>, HTTPS)

  rect rgb(243, 248, 245)
    Note over U,DB: Sign-in, once per device (D8)
    U->>B: Continue with Google
    B->>G: Google Identity Services
    G-->>B: ID token (JWT)
    B->>A: POST /auth/google {idToken}
    A->>G: JWKS (cached)
    A->>A: verify signature, aud, iss, exp, email_verified
    A->>DB: user by Google sub, must be active
    A->>DB: insert refresh token (hashed, new family)
    A-->>B: 200 {accessToken, ~15 min} + Set-Cookie refresh (HttpOnly, Secure, SameSite=Strict)
  end

  rect rgb(238, 235, 228)
    Note over B,DB: Session check on app load (access token lives in memory only)
    B->>A: POST /auth/refresh (cookie)
    A->>DB: token hash valid, not revoked → rotate
    A-->>B: 200 {accessToken} + new cookie
  end

  rect rgb(251, 250, 247)
    Note over U,R: Send a message
    U->>B: type, press Enter
    B->>A: POST /sessions/{id}/messages · Bearer · {clientMessageId, text}
    Note right of B: First send in a new session: POST /agents/{agentId}/sessions<br/>creates the session and sends in one call (F03)
    A->>A: verify access token (signature only, no DB)
    A->>DB: session + agent: owner, agent online, no run in progress
    A->>DB: one transaction: user message + assistant message (status streaming)
    A->>DB: recent history for the payload (D18)
    A-->>B: 200 text/event-stream · event run.started {runId, messageIds}
    A->>R: InvokeAgentRuntime(ARN, runtimeSessionId, {messages, input})
    Note over A: The agent call runs in its own task,<br/>not tied to the HTTP response (D11)
    par agent stream
      loop until the agent finishes
        R-->>A: chunk (AgentCore / Strands format)
        A->>A: translate to app blocks (D10)
        A-->>B: event block.* (text, thinking, tool step, plan, ...)
        opt block ended, or 2 s since last save
          A->>DB: checkpoint assistant blocks (P1)
        end
      end
    and keep-alive
      loop every 15 s, from the API's own timer
        A-->>B: ": ping" (SSE comment)
      end
    end
    R-->>A: end of stream
    A->>DB: final blocks, status complete
    A-->>B: event run.completed · stream closes
    opt first reply in the session
      A->>DB: auto-title the session (background)
    end
    B->>U: finished reply, composer ready
  end
